    {
      "id": 1446,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "ThisData (formerly Revert) provides the ability to backup Dropbox files. File names were rendered within the app in an unescaped manner, meaning if you could get Dropbox to accept a file with a name like `\"><img src=\"x\" onerror=alert(cookie)>.png` you could XSS Revert's backup rendering screen.",
